  "fig.croq.flow.caption": "Every croquette in the Pantry sits in exactly one encrypted pile: the reserve, the treasury's share, or the burnt one. A meal leaves nothing in the cat but weight. Burnt croquettes stay locked in the Pantry; no function can move them, and nobody can read how many there are.",
